@host = http://localhost:5087
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Login (Development seed data)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.com", "password": "Demo123!" }

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Jobs (paged, filtered)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Scheduled&sortBy=scheduledStart&sortDir=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
